  "articleBody": "Bathroom renovations can be really exciting, but it's easy to stumble into a few common traps if you're not prepared. One frequent mistake we see is choosing products too late in the game. You might fall in love with a specific tile, only to find out it has an 8-week lead time, throwing your whole schedule off. That’s why getting your material selections locked in early is so important! Another big one is not thinking about how the renovation will impact the current users of the bathroom. If it's your only bathroom, for example, you'll need a plan for keeping it functional or arranging alternatives. You'll also want to make sure your material choices align with how much maintenance you're willing to do. Some beautiful options require more upkeep than others. Planning for these details upfront can save you a lot of stress and unexpected delays. At HH Remodeling LLC, we guide our clients through these decisions in areas like Centennial and Highlands Ranch to ensure a smooth and satisfying renovation experience.",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-09"
}